  "chapters": [
    {
      "label": "Notice the hurt",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 11.05,
      "text": "Hey, friends. Our time together is too precious to spend making someone feel small. Making fun of someone can hurt, even when we call it a joke.",
      "source": "audio/dino_fenrir_michael_30_70-1.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "66384cb6959bf580efe17d6b76f8192740a106b1ffa3e34e8b318323dee9fbd2",
      "pcmSampleStart": 9600,
      "pcmSamples": 255600
    },
    {
      "label": "Choose what comes next",
      "start": 11.45,
      "end": 19.0,
      "text": "If someone feels hurt, let's stop and listen. We all make mistakes. What matters is what we choose next.",
      "source": "audio/dino_fenrir_michael_30_70-2.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "dd77b44e86db809b033dc300ca066ae35a328b8b9adafc0c3ab27c0b8a43e9fe",
      "pcmSampleStart": 274800,
      "pcmSamples": 181200
    },
    {
      "label": "Make room for everyone",
      "start": 19.4,
      "end": 31.2,
      "text": "We can say sorry, make things right, and help someone feel included. It's never too late to choose kindness. You matter. They matter too. Let's make room for everyone.",
      "source": "audio/dino_fenrir_michael_30_70-3.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "63b147fab22efce5f5a898bd09e3d83987123832bdc32d4abaeb29df431ead37",
      "pcmSampleStart": 465600,
      "pcmSamples": 283200
    }
  ],
